.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida do 10\u00ba Trail das Nozes 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar (GPS: 41.134938, -8.539093).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os respetivos hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra o Trail Sprint de 25 km \u00e0s 09:00, seguido pelo Trail Curto de 10 km e pela Caminhada de 10 km com partidas em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os desn\u00edveis e limites de tempo das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Sprint (25 km) apresenta cerca de 840 m de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado, enquanto o Trail Curto (10 km) conta com cerca de 400 m D+. O tempo limite global de conclus\u00e3o \u00e9 de 5 horas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e valores?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es variam consoante o per\u00edodo: na fase promocional (at\u00e9 16 de agosto) o Trail Sprint custa 15 \u20ac, Trail Curto 12 \u20ac e Caminhada 9 \u20ac; no 1\u00ba per\u00edodo (at\u00e9 30 de setembro) custam 16 \u20ac, 13 \u20ac e 10 \u20ac; no 2\u00ba per\u00edodo (at\u00e9 14 de outubro) custam 18 \u20ac, 15 \u20ac e 10 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando podem ser levantados os dorsais e kits de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os kits podem ser levantados no s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro, na Decathlon da F\u00e1brica do Cobre (10:00 \u00e0s 13:00) e no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar (15:30 \u00e0s 18:00), ou no domingo, 25 de outubro, a partir das 07:30 no secretariado do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"10\u00ba Trail das Nozes 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Gondomar, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Gondomar\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida do 10\u00ba Trail das Nozes 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar (GPS: 41.134938, -8.539093).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os respetivos hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento integra o Trail Sprint de 25 km \u00e0s 09:00, seguido pelo Trail Curto de 10 km e pela Caminhada de 10 km com partidas em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 09:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os desn\u00edveis e limites de tempo das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Sprint (25 km) apresenta cerca de 840 m de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado, enquanto o Trail Curto (10 km) conta com cerca de 400 m D+. O tempo limite global de conclus\u00e3o \u00e9 de 5 horas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e valores?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es variam consoante o per\u00edodo: na fase promocional (at\u00e9 16 de agosto) o Trail Sprint custa 15 \u20ac, Trail Curto 12 \u20ac e Caminhada 9 \u20ac; no 1\u00ba per\u00edodo (at\u00e9 30 de setembro) custam 16 \u20ac, 13 \u20ac e 10 \u20ac; no 2\u00ba per\u00edodo (at\u00e9 14 de outubro) custam 18 \u20ac, 15 \u20ac e 10 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando podem ser levantados os dorsais e kits de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os kits podem ser levantados no s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro, na Decathlon da F\u00e1brica do Cobre (10:00 \u00e0s 13:00) e no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar (15:30 \u00e0s 18:00), ou no domingo, 25 de outubro, a partir das 07:30 no secretariado do evento.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68594,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-58410","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-gondomar","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-trail-das-nozes.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"sel